# Feature notation: A,B,C = largest, 2nd, 3rd of x0..x8; pA,pB,pC their positions.
# "A@S" = A if pA in set S else 0 (same for B, C). Ap = A*pA/8, Aq = A*(8-pA)/8 (same for B).
# m{t} = max(x0..xt); m2_{t} = 2nd largest of x0..xt; gap{t} = ReLU(m{t-1}-x_t);
# xjB+{j} = ReLU(x_j - B); Bxj+{j} = ReLU(B - x_j); sum9 = x0+..+x8.
# Each neuron: h ~= ReLU(sum_k c_k * feature_k), no intercept.
def f(i, x):
    x = np.asarray(x, dtype=float)
    specs, coefs = SPECS[i]
    return model(x, specs, coefs)
